node_modules/

# npm/debug logs at the create-tess package root only. A bare `*.log` (no
# leading slash) matches at ANY depth, including inside the bundled
# template/ tree — that silently gitignored the real, git-tracked fixture
# `template/proving-ground/tasks/06-research-log-analysis/fixture/access.log`
# on every commit (PR #160 gap-loop fix, Reid HIGH: root-caused the 4th
# committed-vs-built drift file — not an ignore.js exclusion, a plain
# gitignore footgun nobody could `git add` past). template/ is committed,
# reviewable source content, generated fresh by `npm run build-template` /
# the `prepack` hook — it must never be partially hidden from git by a
# top-level debug-log pattern.
/npm-debug.log*
!template/**/*.log
